config AIC8800_USB_WLAN_SUPPORT
	tristate "AIC8800 wlan Support"
	help
	  This is support for aic wifi driver.
	  USB transport variant of the AIC8800 WLAN function driver.
	  It needs the firmware loader below and a USB connected
	  AIC8800 part. If unsure, say N.

